   "caption": "Cortex-mean autocorrelation of rest (solid) and task (dashed) runs of the same people in the confirmation set, for raw data, evoked responses removed (sham regression in rest) and evoked responses plus global signal removed; right: change of the intrinsic timescale per study with mean and 95% CI in discovery and confirmation."
  },
